ecting to take price hit when and if that approval comes at the end of this year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/astrazeneca-plc-azn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AZN 2019 Q4","e":"azn","d":"2020-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marc Dunoyer","x":"Despite the higher core operating profit and lower restructuring costs in 2019, our reported EBITDA was much lower due to higher legal provisions in 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/astrazeneca-plc-azn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AZN 2020 Q2","e":"azn","d":"2020-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sachin Jain","x":"Or is there scope to raise guidance in 3Q?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/astrazeneca-azn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AZN 2020 Q2","e":"azn","d":"2020-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Marc Dunoyer","x":"And this is why we believe the -- reiterating our guidance of high single-digit, low double-digits for total revenue remains adequate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/astrazeneca-azn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AZN 2022 Q3","e":"azn","d":"2022-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aradhana Sarin","x":"With our culture of continuous improvement, we have been working hard to drive productivity and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/astrazeneca-plc-azn-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"AZN 2022 Q4","e":"azn","d":"2023-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luisa Hector","x":"So, before any reinvestments, should we expect any of that increase in cost savings to fall to the bottom line, or do you plan to reinvest?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/09/astrazeneca-plc-azn-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"AZN 2023 Q1","e":"azn","d":"2023-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D